    <!-- Timer labels: v17 — grid-aligned pure-interval reminders. The "Remind every"
         cadence is anchored to the session start (ticks at t = N × interval). "Skip
         first" is a filter — reminders whose scheduled tick falls earlier than the
         configured minute are silently dropped, the grid is NOT shifted forward. -->
