    <string name="settings_buzzer_bypass_label">Buzzer on emergency (overrides mute)</string>
    <string name="settings_buzzer_bypass_hint">Plays the Karoo buzzer on crash countdown, SOS firing, and the final 1-min check-in reminder, even if your Karoo is muted. Other non-emergency beeps (ride start, earlier check-in reminders, wellness warnings) still respect mute as usual.</string>
